# head/adult/woman/nose_upturned: the woman's upturned nose: a lit tip turned up
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role nose upturned
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -7 -11
|tr

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -9
|.q.
|ssq

view L key rest origin 1 -9
|.q.
|qtt
